{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brew potions, build bonds, and discover magic in a cozy new world.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve always longed for something more. When a strange dream pulls you forward, you find yourself wondering if any of it could be real. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Witchveil Hollow</strong>, a charming town where witches and other magical creatures live side by side. Craft custom brews, run your own potion shop, and fall in love with a mysterious town.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913650/extras/8d791297094612c0908fb3266e60ed9d.avif?t=1770829382\" width=875 height=240 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913650/extras/732aca79abfcf757587f4b8b52ba1977.avif?t=1770829382\" width=875 height=240 /></span>Craft potions with unlocked recipes by mixing up foraged ingredients. Sell them to the townspeople from the potion house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913650/extras/d5b5b83f5681b0ef7caac077f15e5ea3.avif?t=1770829382\" width=875 height=240 /></span>Travel into new magical locations through ancient portals. Each portal leads to new resources and creatures to expand your magic and potions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913650/extras/f4fa4867356f62cc8d0dc44c44c74fec.avif?t=1770829382\" width=875 height=240 /></span>Meet the residents of Witchveil Hollow. Get to know their personalities, help them with their troubles, and watch your relationships grow into lasting friendships or something more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913650/extras/6b09ba5ea9de51e0cbbf150450290ecb.avif?t=1770829382\" width=875 height=240 /></span>Unlock and wield elemental spells to protect yourself from the creatures that roam beyond the town, balancing cozy life with a burst of adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913650/extras/28ca7019b8e96ccdd90c3a8a50a254bc.avif?t=1770829382\" width=875 height=240 /></span>Dive into an enchanted new world filled with hand-drawn pixel graphics. Witchveil Hollow your own by decorating a home, joining in local traditions, and helping restore the magic that had once been lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913650/extras/3d0be743b505d3c780bf1ed6a45219b0.poster.avif?t=1770829382\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913650/extras/3d0be743b505d3c780bf1ed6a45219b0.webm?t=1770829382\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913650/extras/3d0be743b505d3c780bf1ed6a45219b0.mp4?t=1770829382\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3913650?t=1770829382","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3913650?t=1770829382","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/stea